The Python port of ivcrtest will include code ported from the R package
ivcrtest, whose union-bound routines CIhybrid(), CIcon(), CIcon_TNbounds()
and CIproj_p() are adapted from the UnionBounds R package by Xinyue Bei,
https://github.com/xinyuebei-econ/UnionBounds, which accompanies

  Bei, X. (2024). Inference on union bounds. SSRN Working Paper 5023605.
  Version of October 6, 2025. Available at https://ssrn.com/abstract=5023605
  or doi: 10.2139/ssrn.5023605.

